":null,"created_at":"2025-12-12T13:42:11Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/issues/comments/3646822294","html_url":"https://github.com/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/issues/6446#issuecomment-3646822294","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/issues/6446","id":3646822294,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAbWLc7ZXheW","user":{"login":"no-simpler","id":30579893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNTc5ODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30579893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler","html_url":"https://github.com/no-simpler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-12T14:56:30Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T14:56:30Z","body":"@sebastianbergmann \n\nThis issue proves flaky to reproduce, but I think I do see the root cause.\n\n- `\\PHPUnit\\Runner\\CodeCoverage` relies on `private bool $collecting` to maintain cadence (start-stop-start-stop).\n  - If `::start` or `::stop` is called with `$collecting` in unexpected state, the call becomes a no-op.\n  - `::start` flips `$collecting` to `true` and _immediately_ starts the timer.\n  - `::stop` stops the timer, **does a lot of other things**, and _only then_ flips `$collecting` to `false`.\n  - If something (exception) happens in the middle of `::stop`, `$collecting` is never flipped back to `false`.\n  - On next test, `::start` is a no-op.\n  - `::stop` does work, because `$collecting` is still `true`.\n  - But the timer is not started so we `throw new NoActiveTimerException`.\n\nError path on my machine is:\n\n  - `\\PHPUnit\\Runner\\CodeCoverage::start`\n  - ...\n  - `\\PHPUnit\\Runner\\CodeCoverage::stop`:\n    - Stop timer.\n    - Call `\\SebastianBergmann\\CodeCoverage\\CodeCoverage::stop`.\n      - Call `\\SebastianBergmann\\CodeCoverage\\CodeCoverage::performUnintentionallyCoveredCodeCheck`\n      - `throw new UnintentionallyCoveredCodeException`\n      - `\\PHPUnit\\Framework\\TestRunner::run` catches the exception, emits a warning, and **continues executing tests**.\n    - `$collecting` is never flipped to `false`.\n    - Next test fails as described above.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/issues/comments/3646822294/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"no-simpler","id":30579893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNTc5ODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30579893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler","html_url":"https://github.com/no-simpler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/no-simpler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.git